<title>UK: Nat Power sells 38.6 mln of Southern.</title>
<headline>Nat Power sells 38.6 mln of Southern.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's National Power said it had entered into an agreement to sell 38.63 million shares of Southern Electric.</p>
<p>National Power said the sale represented eight percent in Southern Electric which was up 4 1/2 pence up at 430. National Power was quoted 11 pence higher at 574p at 0908 GMT.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
